    "detailed_description": "Sweep Serf is a 2D puzzle platformer where players must use their wit navigate through minesweeper-like obstacles and get the highest scores.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHowever, players have more at their disposal than just their smarts to make it through. There are lots of items to unearth and craft to solve even the toughest roadblocks - and since each run is randomly generated, you can be sure that each playthrough is a fun and unique experience!",
